# Core architecture

- Read `.cursor/rules.md` before inspecting or changing project files.
- Keep the application a Next.js App Router modular monolith.
- Organize domain logic under `src/modules`; keep routes and pages thin.
- Server Components are the default. Add `"use client"` only at the smallest interactive boundary.
- Keep public site, admin, auth, content, leads, media and database concerns separated.
- Do not import server-only modules into Client Components.
- Use the `@/*` alias for cross-directory imports.
- Keep changes inside the requested task; do not implement future plan tasks.
